  (if `indices.shape[-1] < tensor.shape.rank`) along dimension
  `indices.shape[-1]` of `tensor.shape`.  `updates` is a tensor with shape

  ```
  indices.shape[:-1] + tensor.shape[indices.shape[-1]:]
